        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 980, Single Cylinder Grade 1 Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Kwikset, the 980-S SmartKey single cylinder deadbolt is rated as an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 1 security lock. It is designed with a patented side locking bar technology offers improved security by protecting against lock bumping. It is made of solid brass and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. A single cylinder deadbolt, this front door lock is operated by a key on the exterior and a thumbturn on the interior. Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" and it will fit 1-3/4\" door thicknesses.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <b>Smartkey</b> Kwikset Lock offers convenience and security. It allows you to re-key the lock yourself without removing from the door; this mean you will be able to key all your SmartKey locks to one Kwikset key. Smartkey Deadbolts offer the highest grade of security with a standard ANSI/BHMA Grade 1 Cylinder. It is pick resistant and bump proof.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key on the outside and by a thumbturn on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching  \r\n<a href=\"/products/grade-1-double-cylinder-deadbolt-kwikset-985-s\"><b>Kwikset Grade 1 Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b> Features</b> of the Kwikset Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Security</li>\r\n<li>Passes UL437 security tests.</li>\r\n<li>Patented side locking bar technology offers improved security by protecting against lock bumping.</li>\r\n<li>SmartKey anti-pick.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt throw, titanium alloy core.</li>\r\n<li>Free spinning cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset 980, Grade 1 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Length: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for both 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" or 1-1/2\" Crossbore Hole</li>\r\n<li>1-1/4\" x 3-5/8\" Square Corner Strike Plate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
